# Coge Canon - Edge Brain Execution Layer

```yaml
header:
  id: COGE_CANON
  intent: SPEC
  version: v1.0.0
```

## Coge Responsibilities (Per Era 5)

```yaml
coge:
  purpose:
    - parse SIO intent
    - classify complexity
    - hydrate context
    - route to Brain or Cloud
```

## Coge Flow

```text
Intent
  ↓
SIO Parser
  ↓
CAT Router
  ↓
Capacity Estimator
  ↓
Brain (local) or Cloud (remote)
```

## Coge + CAT Integration

```rust
// Coge dispatch via CAT
pub enum CogeIntent {
    BrainPrompt,
    BrainModelVerify,
    BrainReplayRun,
    ZeusForward,
}

pub fn dispatch(intent: &str, payload: &str) -> Result<Vec<u32>, &'static str> {
    match intent {
        "brain.prompt" => CatDispatcher::dispatch("prompt", payload),
        "brain.model.verify" => CatDispatcher::dispatch("model.verify", payload),
        "brain.replay.run" => CatDispatcher::dispatch("replay.run", payload),
        _ => Err("route_to_zeus"),
    }
}
```

## Predefined CAT Registry

| Intent | Manifest | Renderer |
|--------|----------|----------|
| brain.prompt | `brain_prompt()` | CLI/Chat/HTML |
| brain.model.verify | `brain_model_verify()` | CLI |
| brain.replay.run | `brain_replay_run()` | CLI |

## Integration Points

```text
brain/cli  →  Coge  →  fem/cat
              ↑
        SIO parser
        CAT dispatcher
        Capacity estimator
```